{"5014200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tame or Conquered", "steam_appid": 5014200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5014200/extras/d199d12852af64fb453cc00759814e02.avif?t=1788019306\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5014200/extras_big/d199d12852af64fb453cc00759814e02.avif?t=1788019306 width=1560 height=636 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>News: Demo coming ASAP! 🦋</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ <strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right after getting hit by a truck, you have two choices:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   1. Marry one of the 7 Dragon Blessed, or</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   2. Become a big tree and die.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Warning:</i></strong><i> you have 6 months left before the deadline.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next thing you know, you're dragged into their whims at the new magic school! Each guy is a different kind of red flag carrying their own twisted nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Words for the Guys? Hot, Crazy, Yandere &amp; Dangerous!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Will you tame them, or will you submit and be conquered instead?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes, this seemingly simple isekai goes darker the deeper you go.. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the whispers of cults spread everywhere, only you can answer this:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you uncover the truth,  or will you stay put like a little pup?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ <strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Different Yandere Archetypes to Romance!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 Endings Across 4 Ending Types: Tame, Conquered, Doom, &amp; Hidden!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Character Art, CGs, BGM, &amp; Background!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark romance meets  fantasy academy &amp; psychological thriller!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the mysteries surrounding you..</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ <strong>CHARACTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>      Take a look at the dragon blessed.. </i>🦋</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5014200/extras/6883196e9c3437413fa5ea97296a1aaa.avif?t=1788019306\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5014200/extras_big/6883196e9c3437413fa5ea97296a1aaa.webp?t=1788019306 width=1560 height=627 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                ✦✦✦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5014200/extras/2c2a521f6250ba9645873bd2c9052ba1.avif?t=1788019306\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5014200/extras_big/2c2a521f6250ba9645873bd2c9052ba1.webp?t=1788019306 width=1560 height=627 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                ✦✦✦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5014200/extras/397ec2f0b4b1bd985d8d72d3af778aa2.avif?t=1788019306\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5014200/extras_big/397ec2f0b4b1bd985d8d72d3a